From d41e83fafe2de0341265c096a439a68579f9309b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:05:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] gamespace: prevent duplicate overlay on rotation

rotating the device triggers GameBarService.onConfigurationChanged, which
called updateRootBarView() to removeViewImmediate and addView on every
rotation without checking shouldClose or barAdded. meanwhile
onGameLeave() gated removal on isAttachedToWindow, which stays false
until the first layout traversal, leaving orphaned overlays behind when
the game exited or rotated before attachment.

update the bar layout in-place via updateViewLayout(), guard rotation
and cleanup using barAdded and view parent state, avoid posting
uncancellable lambdas or re-registering listeners, and track pending
GameBarService bindings in SessionService.
